{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00056","headline":"安定城楼 · 李商隐","name":"安定城楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢递高城百尺楼，绿杨枝外尽汀洲。贾生年少虚垂泪， 王粲春来更远游。永忆江湖归白发，欲回天地入扁舟。 不知腐鼠成滋味，猜意鸳雏竟未休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"周啸天"}